### Get all tickets (no filter)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets

###

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN

###

### Filter by priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH

###

### Filter by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?category=Email

### Paged tickets - defaults (page 0, size 5, createdAt desc)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged

###

### Paged tickets - page 0, size 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=2

###

### Paged tickets - page 1, size 2 (second page, per requirement #5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=2

###

### Paged tickets - sorted by priority ascending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=priority&direction=asc

### Paged tickets - page 0, size 5 (explicit)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5

###

### Paged tickets - page 1, size 5
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=5

###

### Paged tickets - explicit sort by createdAt descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc